flowchart TD
    EB[Amazon EventBridge Cron] --> M1[Monthly: Vijayawada + Vizag urban]
    EB --> Q1[Quarterly: all 5 districts]
    EB --> A1[Annual: full YoY]
    M1 --> LAM[AWS Lambda Job Orchestrator]
    Q1 --> LAM
    A1 --> LAM
    LAM --> SQS[SQS District Jobs] --> EP[SageMaker Endpoint ml.g4dn.xlarge - T4 GPU]
    S3M[(S3 Model Registry best_model.pth)] --> EP
    S3I[(S3 Imagery chips)] --> EP
    EP --> PROC[Per-district: normalize -> TTA -> V4 post -> change detection] --> EXP[Export GeoTIFF + SHP + PNG]
    EXP --> S3R[(S3 Results versioned)]
    S3R --> AGOL[ArcGIS Online layer update - arcgis Python API]
    S3R --> SNS[SNS email notification]
    AGOL --> WEB[Web App via REST API]
